["<aside class=\"callout warn\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Steps 1 to 3</th><th>Steps 4 to 6</th><th>Steps 7 to 9</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Paper, clock, season</td><td>Target, road, buildings</td><td>Land, backstop, shot</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>All 9 must be yes. One no, or one \"not sure\": do not shoot.</li></ul><aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>You get about 3 seconds. The 9 questions must be a habit before the animal shows up.</p></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to use the 9 steps</summary><ul><li>Same 9 steps as the \"Is it legal to shoot?\" card in the Field tab.</li><li>Every answer must be <strong>yes</strong>. One no, or one \"not sure\", and you do not shoot.</li><li>Practise saying them in order on every walk until they are automatic.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 774\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Flowchart: is it legal to shoot? Answer nine questions in order. Yes goes down to the next question; no at any step goes right, to DO NOT SHOOT. 1. Licences on me? 2. Legal hours right now? 3. Season open, MU (Management Unit), sex? 4. 100% sure what it is? 5. Off road, out of vehicle? 6. Over 100 m from buildings? 7. Allowed on this land? 8. Safe backstop? 9. Clean shot, in my range? All 9 yes: you may shoot. Any doubt at any step means no.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"774\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Is it legal to shoot?</text>\n<rect x=\"318\" y=\"46\" width=\"74\" height=\"624\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text transform=\"translate(362 358) rotate(-90)\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DO NOT SHOOT</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"46\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"70.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Licences on me?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"70.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 70.0 L307.0 64.0 L307.0 76.0z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"109\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 118.0 L144.5 108.0 L133.5 108.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"118\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"142.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Legal hours right now?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"142.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"142.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 142.0 L307.0 135.9 L307.0 148.1z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"181\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 190.0 L144.5 180.0 L133.5 180.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"183\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"190\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"214.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"219\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Season open, MU, sex?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"214.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"214.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 214.0 L307.0 207.9 L307.0 220.1z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"238\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"253\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 262.0 L144.5 252.0 L133.5 252.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"262\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"286.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"291\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">100% sure what it is?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"286.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"286.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 286.0 L307.0 279.9 L307.0 292.1z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"325\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 334.0 L144.5 324.0 L133.5 324.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"327\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"334\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"358.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"363\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"364\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Off road, out of vehicle?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"358.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"358.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 358.0 L307.0 351.9 L307.0 364.1z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"351\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"397\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 406.0 L144.5 396.0 L133.5 396.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"406\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"430.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"436\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Over 100 m from buildings?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"430.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"430.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 430.0 L307.0 423.9 L307.0 436.1z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"423\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"454\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"469\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 478.0 L144.5 468.0 L133.5 468.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"471\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"478\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"502.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"507\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"508\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Allowed on this land?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"502.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"502.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 502.0 L307.0 495.9 L307.0 508.1z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"495\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"526\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"541\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 550.0 L144.5 540.0 L133.5 540.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"543\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"550\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"574.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"579\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"580\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Safe backstop?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"574.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"574.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 574.0 L307.0 568.0 L307.0 580.0z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"567\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"598\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"613\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 622.0 L144.5 612.0 L133.5 612.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"622\" width=\"262\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"32.0\" cy=\"646.0\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"651\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"652\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Clean shot, in my range?</text>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"646.0\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"646.0\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M318.0 646.0 L307.0 640.0 L307.0 652.0z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"639\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No</text>\n<line x1=\"139\" y1=\"670\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"687\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139.0 696.0 L144.5 686.0 L133.5 686.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"696\" width=\"384\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"726\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">All 9 yes: you may shoot</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"751\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Any doubt at any step means no.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Yes goes down. No goes right, to DO NOT SHOOT.</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 312\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: the sun rises. Two hours before sunrise, nothing is legal. At 1 hour before sunrise, deer and grouse are legal, ducks and geese must wait. At 30 minutes before sunrise, ducks and geese are legal too. Then sunrise. In the evening deer end 1 hour after sunset and ducks end 30 minutes after sunset.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"312\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\" fill=\"#1f2a3a\"><animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#1f2a3a;#5a6f8f;#a9c4de\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></rect>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"216\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#e8590c\"><animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"216;190;172\" keyTimes=\"0;0.85;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></circle>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"190\" width=\"400\" height=\"122\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n<path d=\"M0 190 Q 100 170 200 186 T 400 180 L400 196 L0 196 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2 hours before sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1 hour before sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"7s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">30 minutes before sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"7s\" dur=\"0.4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"70\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer, grouse: wait</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks, geese: wait</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"70\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer, grouse: GO</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks, geese: wait</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"70\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer, grouse: GO</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks, geese: GO</text></g>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks start 30 minutes later.</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evenings: deer 1 hour after sunset,</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ducks 30 minutes after.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Deer start 1 hour before sunrise. Ducks 30 minutes. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Step 1: Licences on me?</li><li>Step 2: Legal hours right now?</li><li>Step 3: Season open for this animal, here, today?</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each step in full</summary><ol><li><strong>Licences on me?</strong> Photo ID, <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"FWID\">FWID</button> (Fish and Wildlife ID) number, all your species licences for the year (used and unused), and the federal bird permit for ducks <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Legal hours?</strong> Deer and quail: 1 hour before sunrise to 1 hour after sunset <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Ducks: 30 minutes before sunrise to 30 minutes after sunset <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Season open for this species, sex and antler type, in this <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"MU\">MU</button> (Management Unit), today?</strong> Check the synopsis table for your exact MU. Dates: the Rules tab, read from the official synopsis.</li></ol><ul><li>Antler rules like \"4 point\" mean you count points <strong>before</strong> the shot. Tip.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 510\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 100 metre ring, 109 yards, around an occupied house. A deer inside the ring: no hunting and no shooting. A deer outside the ring: check the other rules. The ring counts around an occupied dwelling house, a farm or ranch building with people or domestic animals, a church, a school building or school yard, a playground and a regional district park. Owner permission does not lift it.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"510\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"384\" height=\"250\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e6e9d4\"/>\n<path d=\"M98 242 l2 -6 M102 242 l0 -7 M106 242 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M61 185 l2 -6 M65 185 l0 -7 M69 185 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M46 84 l2 -6 M50 84 l0 -7 M54 84 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M86 213 l2 -6 M90 213 l0 -7 M94 213 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M47 82 l2 -6 M51 82 l0 -7 M55 82 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M21 89 l2 -6 M25 89 l0 -7 M29 89 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M110 248 l2 -6 M114 248 l0 -7 M118 248 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M37 166 l2 -6 M41 166 l0 -7 M45 166 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M349 158 l2 -6 M353 158 l0 -7 M357 158 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M67 44 l2 -6 M71 44 l0 -7 M75 44 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M86 238 l2 -6 M90 238 l0 -7 M94 238 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M64 198 l2 -6 M68 198 l0 -7 M72 198 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M50 182 l2 -6 M54 182 l0 -7 M58 182 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M275 239 l2 -6 M279 239 l0 -7 M283 239 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M328 141 l2 -6 M332 141 l0 -7 M336 141 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M88 63 l2 -6 M92 63 l0 -7 M96 63 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M41 229 l2 -6 M45 229 l0 -7 M49 229 l-2 -6\" stroke=\"#a9b37f\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/>\n<g data-tip=\"The 100 m ring|No hunting or shooting within 100 m (109 yd) of an occupied house, farm or ranch building, church, school, playground or regional district park (99%, synopsis page 10).\">\n<circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"128\" r=\"98\" fill=\"#e8590c\" fill-opacity=\".12\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"Occupied|Occupied means by people or domestic animals. Animals in a barn count (99%). Your brother's house counts, even with his OK (95%, my reading).\">\n<g transform=\"translate(196 136) scale(1.15)\"><path d=\"M10 -26 C14 -32 8 -36 12 -42 M16 -26 C20 -33 14 -37 18 -44\" stroke=\"#9a9a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"-30\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><rect x=\"-20\" y=\"-14\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f3ead8\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M-25 -12 L0 -32 L25 -12z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"-4\" y=\"0\" width=\"9\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><rect x=\"-16\" y=\"-6\" width=\"9\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#9cc0dc\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"-6\" width=\"9\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#9cc0dc\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/></g>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"100 m (109 yd)|100 m is close: a rifle bullet travels kilometres. Rangefind the house from each likely stand and mark a 100 m ring on your phone map (Tip).\">\n<line x1=\"226\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"286\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M293.0 150.0 L283.0 144.5 L283.0 155.5z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"246\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100 m</text>\n<text x=\"246\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(109 yd)</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"196\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#e6e9d4\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">occupied</text>\n<g data-tip=\"Inside the ring|No hunting and no shooting inside it (99%).\">\n<g transform=\"translate(138 166) scale(-1.15 1.15)\"><path d=\"M-8 -18 L-10 0 M-4 -18 L-3 0 M12 -18 L13 0 M16 -18 L18 0\" stroke=\"#5a3e26\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-12 -28 C-12 -34 -4 -34 6 -34 C14 -34 20 -32 20 -26 C20 -20 16 -17 8 -17 L-6 -17 C-10 -17 -12 -21 -12 -28z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><path d=\"M-10 -30 L-16 -42 L-12 -44 L-6 -32z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><path d=\"M-16 -42 C-20 -43 -24 -40 -24 -38 L-20 -37 C-17 -37 -14 -39 -13 -41z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><path d=\"M-14 -44 L-18 -50 L-12 -45z M-12 -44 L-9 -50 L-10 -44z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><ellipse cx=\"18\" cy=\"-27\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#f3ead8\"/><circle cx=\"-18\" cy=\"-41\" r=\".9\" fill=\"#111\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"138\" cy=\"142\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"3.4\"/><path d=\"M117 121 L159 163\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"3.4\"/>\n<text x=\"138\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#e6e9d4\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">NO</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"Outside the ring|Other rules still apply. Private land needs permission, and hunting cultivated land without the owner's consent is unlawful (99%).\">\n<g transform=\"translate(350 128) scale(1.15 1.15)\"><path d=\"M-8 -18 L-10 0 M-4 -18 L-3 0 M12 -18 L13 0 M16 -18 L18 0\" stroke=\"#5a3e26\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-12 -28 C-12 -34 -4 -34 6 -34 C14 -34 20 -32 20 -26 C20 -20 16 -17 8 -17 L-6 -17 C-10 -17 -12 -21 -12 -28z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><path d=\"M-10 -30 L-16 -42 L-12 -44 L-6 -32z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><path d=\"M-16 -42 C-20 -43 -24 -40 -24 -38 L-20 -37 C-17 -37 -14 -39 -13 -41z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><path d=\"M-14 -44 L-18 -50 L-12 -45z M-12 -44 L-9 -50 L-10 -44z\" fill=\"#9a7350\"/><ellipse cx=\"18\" cy=\"-27\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#f3ead8\"/><circle cx=\"-18\" cy=\"-41\" r=\".9\" fill=\"#111\"/></g>\n<text x=\"386\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#e6e9d4\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">outside</text>\n<text x=\"386\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#e6e9d4\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">check other rules</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Counts within 100 m of:</text>\n<rect x=\"8.0\" y=\"290\" width=\"124\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(70.0 324)\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"-14\" y=\"-8\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#f3ead8\"/><path d=\"M-18 -6 L0 -20 L18 -6z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><rect x=\"-3\" y=\"2\" width=\"7\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M8 -22 C11 -25 7 -27 10 -29\" stroke=\"#9a9a8a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">House</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lived in</text>\n<g data-tip=\"Farm or ranch building|Barns or sheds with animals inside count too (99%).\">\n<rect x=\"138.0\" y=\"290\" width=\"124\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(200.0 324)\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M-18 12 V-6 L-10 -16 H10 L18 -6 V12z\" fill=\"#b3261e\"/><path d=\"M-6 12 V0 H6 V12 M-6 0 L6 12 M6 0 L-6 12\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M-18 -6 H18\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Farm or ranch</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">people or animals</text>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"268.0\" y=\"290\" width=\"124\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(330.0 324)\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"-14\" y=\"-4\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#f3ead8\"/><path d=\"M-6 -4 V-16 L0 -22 L6 -16 V-4z\" fill=\"#f3ead8\"/><path d=\"M0 -24 V-32 M-3.5 -29 H3.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-3 12 V4 A3 3 0 0 1 3 4 V12z\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/></g>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Church</text>\n<rect x=\"8.0\" y=\"382\" width=\"124\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(70.0 416)\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-6\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#f2d49b\"/><path d=\"M-20 -6 L0 -16 L20 -6z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -16 V-30\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M0 -30 H10 V-24 H0z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><rect x=\"-13\" y=\"-1\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#9cc0dc\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"-1\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#9cc0dc\"/><rect x=\"-3\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/></g>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">School</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"464\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">or school yard</text>\n<rect x=\"138.0\" y=\"382\" width=\"124\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(200.0 416)\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M-16 12 L-8 -16 L0 12 M-12 -2 H-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-8 -16 H2 C10 -16 12 4 20 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-16 12 H20\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/></g>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Playground</text>\n<g data-tip=\"Regional district park|Most regional district parks also ban firearm and bow discharge (99%, page 9).\">\n<rect x=\"268.0\" y=\"382\" width=\"124\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(330.0 416)\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M-8 12 V2\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"-8\" cy=\"-8\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#6f8a5a\"/><path d=\"M4 6 H20 M6 6 V12 M18 6 V12 M4 2 H20\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/></g>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Regional</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"464\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">district park</text>\n</g>\n<text data-tip=\"Permission does not lift it|The only owner exemption is slaughtering their own livestock near their buildings. It is not for hunting (95%, my reading).\" x=\"200\" y=\"496\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Permission does not lift it.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Step 4: 100% sure what it is?</li><li>Step 5: Off the road, out of the vehicle?</li><li>Step 6: Over 100 m (109 yd) from occupied buildings?</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each step in full</summary><ol><li><strong>100% sure what it is?</strong> Species, sex, antler points. For ducks: species before you shoot. Not sure means no. Tip.</li><li><strong>Off the road, out of the vehicle?</strong> No hunting from a motor vehicle, and no hunting from a boat while its motor is pushing it (99%, page 11 items 22 and 23). No shooting across, or hunting on, the road allowance of a numbered highway or a 2 lane public road the province maintains <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. No loaded firearm in or on a vehicle or <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ATV\">ATV</button> (all terrain vehicle) <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Over 100 m (109 yd) from any occupied house, farm or ranch building?</strong> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. This includes your brother's house on the property (95%, my reading).</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 572\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Checklist: can I shoot here? Every one of nine checks must be yes, and a check that does not apply counts as yes. 1 outside every National Park. 2 outside every ecological reserve. 3 not in a BC Park, or its page allows hunting in an open season. 4 over 100 metres (109 yards) from occupied buildings and schools. 5 off the road allowance and not shooting across it. 6 outside No Shooting and No Hunting Areas. 7 near a listed highway: check its 400 metre band in the Rule Book; some ban rifles and slugs, some ban all hunting. 8 fenced, posted, leased or crop land: the owner said yes. 9 in a town: the local bylaw allows it. Any no: do not shoot. All yes: the place is OK; now check season, licence, target and backstop.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"572\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"16\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Need YES to all 9</text>\n<text x=\"384\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"end\">Does not apply = yes</text>\n<g data-tip=\"Closed places|No hunting in any National Park. Ecological reserves are closed to hunting and to firing any firearm or bow.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"50\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"70\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"75.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 70) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-15 11 L-4 -9 L2 1 L6 -4 L15 11z\"/><path d=\"M-4 -9 L-1 -4 L-6 -3z\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Outside National Parks</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"94\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"114\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"119.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 114) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-12 12 C-14 -4 -2 -14 14 -13 C14 4 4 13 -12 12z\"/><path d=\"M-12 12 L6 -6\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Outside ecological reserves</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"BC Parks|Many ban hunting. Check the park's own page that hunting is allowed, then hunt only in a lawful open season.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"138\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"158\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"163.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 158) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-8 -14 L-1 0 L-4 0 L1 9 L-17 9 L-12 0 L-15 0z\"/><path d=\"M8 -10 L14 1 L12 1 L16 10 L0 10 L4 1 L2 1z\"/><rect x=\"-9.5\" y=\"9\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\"/><rect x=\"6.5\" y=\"10\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">BC Park allows it, in season</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"The 100 m rule|No hunting or shooting within 100 m (109 yd) of a church, school, playground, regional district park, home, or farm building with people or animals in it.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"182\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"202\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"207.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 202) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-14 0 L0 -13 L14 0z\"/><rect x=\"-10\" y=\"0\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\"/><rect x=\"-3\" y=\"5\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Over 100 m (109 yd) from homes</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"Road allowance|On numbered highways and public roads of 2 lanes or more: no shooting across or within the road allowance, and no hunting within it.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"226\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"246\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"251.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 246) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-6 -14 L-14 14 H14 L6 -14z\"/><path d=\"M0 -12 V-6 M0 -1 V5 M0 9 V14\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Off road allowance, not across it</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"Two kinds of area|A No Shooting Area bans firing a firearm. A No Hunting Area bans hunting itself, bow or firearm.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"270\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"290\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"295.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 290) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><circle r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M-9 -9 L9 9\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Outside No Shooting, No Hunting Areas</text>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"314\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"334\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"339.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 334) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-12 -13 H12 V2 C12 9 6 13 0 15 C-6 13 -12 9 -12 2z\"/><path d=\"M-6 -6 H6 M-6 0 H6\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Listed highway: check its 400 m band</text>\n<g data-tip=\"Private and leased land|A fence all the way round or no trespassing signs at each way in means it is closed without the owner's permission. Cultivated land needs consent too.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"358\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"378\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"383.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 378) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"-15\" y=\"-10\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"23\"/><rect x=\"11.5\" y=\"-10\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"23\"/><path d=\"M-12 -5 H12 M-12 3 H12 M-12 3 L12 -5\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"384\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Fenced, posted, leased, crop: owner OK</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"Towns|Inside a city or district, the local bylaw decides where you may shoot. The synopsis does not print bylaws.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"402\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#e3d8c0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"422\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"427.5\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(58 422) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"-15\" y=\"-4\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\"/><rect x=\"-4\" y=\"-14\" width=\"11\" height=\"27\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"0\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\"/><path d=\"M-1 -10 h2 v2 h-2z M3 -10 h2 v2 h-2z M-1 -4 h2 v2 h-2z M3 -4 h2 v2 h-2z M-1 2 h2 v2 h-2z M3 2 h2 v2 h-2z\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"428\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Town: bylaw allows it</text>\n</g>\n<g data-tip=\"Any no|Do not shoot. Killing wildlife while trespassing or breaking any other law is its own offence.\">\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"450\" width=\"384\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(32 471) scale(0.7)\"><circle r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M-9 -9 L9 9\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/></g>\n<text x=\"58\" y=\"478\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">Any NO: DO NOT SHOOT</text></g>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"500\" width=\"384\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<path d=\"M20 531 l7 7 l13 -14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<text x=\"58\" y=\"526\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">All yes: the place is OK</text>\n<text x=\"58\" y=\"549\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">Now: season, licence, target, backstop</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Step 7: Allowed on this land?</li></ul><ul><li>Step 8: Safe backstop?</li></ul><ul><li>Step 9: Clean shot, inside my tested range?</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each step in full</summary><ol><li><strong>Allowed on this land?</strong> <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Crown land\">Crown land</button> that is open, or owner's permission. Not a park closed to hunting, an ecological reserve or a No Shooting Area <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Safe <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Backstop\">Backstop</button>?</strong> Earth behind the animal. No skyline. No people, road, livestock or building beyond. Tip, and your safety course rule.</li><li><strong>Clean shot inside your tested range?</strong> Broadside or quartering away, still animal, steady rest. Tip.</li></ol><ul><li>Steps 8 and 9 are about safety and ethics. They are not optional.</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>When in doubt, don't. The deer will be there next year. A bad shot follows you forever.</p></aside>","<aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Counting antler points after the shot.</li><li>Forgetting that ducks start 30 minutes later than deer in the morning.</li><li>Shooting from the ATV seat \"because the engine is off\".</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Walking in, say the 9 steps out loud once. At the stand, rangefind the nearest building and the road.</p></aside><div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s12-legal\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:0\"><span>I can say all 9 steps from memory</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:1\"><span>I know today's legal start and end for deer and for ducks</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:2\"><span>I know my MU and today's open seasons</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:3\"><span>I rangefinded the house and the road from my stand</span></label></div>","<ul><li>Every source, page and date checked: tap below.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: every source, page and date checked</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly. Page 4 (an ATV is a motor vehicle), pages 5 and 8 (photo ID, FWID number, carry all species licences), page 7 (federal permit), page 9 (parks, ecological reserves), page 10 (road allowance, 100 m, No Shooting Areas), page 11 items 22, 23, 28, 37 and 38 (no hunting from a vehicle or a motor driven boat, no loaded firearm in or on a vehicle, hours). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bclaws.gov.bc.ca/civix/document/id/complete/statreg/190_84_01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hunting Regulation, B.C. Reg. 190/84</a>, read directly, current to 22 September 2026: s. 14 (hours). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/SOR-2022-105/FullText.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Migratory Birds Regulations, 2022 (SOR/2022-105)</a>, read directly, current to 2026-09-21: s. 28(3)(b) (duck hours south of 60 degrees north; no other BC hours in Schedule 3). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li>Steps 4, 8 and 9 are safety and ethics habits (Tip), not quoted law.</li><li>Full rule detail and certainty: Phase 2 Session 5, BC rules you must know.</li></ul></details>"]